# Comments & Logging (Mandatory)

When **implementing or modifying** business code under `senior-post-api`、`senior-post-flutter`、`senior-post-manage/src`, you **must** follow the comment and logging sections in:

| 端 | Skill（先读再写） |
|----|-------------------|
| 后端 | `.cursor/skills/backend-foundation-capabilities/SKILL.md` → **§11 Comments & Logging** |
| 前端 | `.cursor/skills/frontend-engineering-conventions/SKILL.md` |

## Hard requirements

1. **Methods**：Biz / 公开 API / Provider / Remote 公开方法写清业务意图与副作用。
2. **Complex branches**：非显然 `if`/`switch`/状态迁移旁注释「为何走此路径」。
3. **Key logs**：写库成功/拒绝、外部调用失败、定时任务汇总、额度/审核拦截、前端关键 API 失败 — 按 skill 约定级别记录。
4. **Never**：废话注释、注释死代码、日志打印 Token/密码/敏感 PII。

## Self-check before finishing

- [ ] Read the relevant skill section this session
- [ ] New/changed public methods have intent comments
- [ ] Complex branches explained
- [ ] Key paths logged without sensitive data
